# Frontend

## Features (parity with HTML views)
| Feature | Responsibility |
|---------|----------------|
| `dashboard` | Metrics, partner cards, installment table, payment modal, filters |
| `setup` | Plan meta, partners CRUD, templates, installment list |
| `data` | JSON/CSV/ICS export-import, print/report |

## Patterns
- Standalone components + `inject()`; prefer signals / `resource` over ad-hoc Subjects
- HTTP only via `core` services; no business formulas in templates
- Share/status/settlement display values come from API (or shared typed helpers that mirror Domain)
- Currency: `Intl.NumberFormat('tr-TR')` + `₺`
- UI copy: Turkish; code identifiers: English

## UX rules from prototype
- Payment click → modal (status, date, paidBy, note) — not silent toggle alone
- Delivery countdown from `deliveryInstId`
- Filters: all / pending / partial / paid; search by name/date
- Print signatures must use current partners (never hardcode names)

## Anti-patterns
- `innerHTML` with user data (XSS)
- Recalculating shares differently from backend
- Cards/modals that invent fields not in the domain model without a product decision
